[ar:Aarav Kharade]
[ti:HUMAN BEHIND THE MACHINE]

[00:05.59]Can you hear me?
[00:07.57]Under all the noise,
[00:09.15]Under all the numbers,
[00:10.70]There’s still a human voice.
[00:12.70]Oh-oh, can you hear us now?
[00:20.14]A million faces wear borrowed smiles,
[00:24.09]A thousand little lies can travel miles.
[00:27.89]A stranger’s voice can wear your brother’s name,
[00:31.31]And truth can disappear inside a game.
[00:34.55]Our secrets change hands behind the glass,
[00:37.59]While silent eyes watch every road we pass.
[00:41.41]If a number says you’re not enough,
[00:45.07]Who remembers you were human first?
[00:49.83]Who gets left outside the door?
[00:53.36]Who gets forgotten when they want more?
[00:57.73]If we can build a world so bright,
[01:01.65]Can we teach it to protect a life?
[01:04.98]THERE’S A HEART BEHIND THE MACHINE!
[01:08.00]There’s a life behind every screen!
[01:11.97]Let it reach for the stars above,
[01:15.24]But never let it forget our love!
[01:18.92]Let it heal, let it help, let hope open every door,
[01:22.30]Give a little light to those who need it more.
[01:24.27]We can make a better world, let compassion be our sign:
[01:27.75]The heart behind the machine
[01:30.57]Must be yours and mine!
[01:34.12]Oh-oh-oh, yours and mine!
[01:37.35]Keep the human light alive!
[01:45.74]A doctor finds a warning just in time,
[01:49.05]A child discovers worlds between the lines.
[01:52.53]A voice returns to someone who couldn’t speak,
[01:55.57]A distant friend is no longer out of reach.
[01:59.90]But what is progress worth if someone’s left behind?
[02:03.12]What good is all that knowledge without kindness in its mind?
[02:06.80]The smartest answer in the world won’t do
[02:10.54]If it forgets the people it was made to serve.
[02:15.03]Who gets left outside the door?
[02:18.85]Who gets forgotten when they want more?
[02:22.31]If we can build a world so bright,
[02:26.26]Can we teach it to protect a life?
[02:30.87]THERE’S A HEART BEHIND THE MACHINE!
[02:34.98]There’s a life behind every screen!
[02:37.77]Let it reach for the stars above,
[02:41.73]But never let it forget our love!
[02:45.59]Let it heal, let it help, let hope open every door,
[02:48.84]Give a little light to those who need it more.
[02:50.84]We can make a better world, let compassion be our sign:
[02:54.34]The heart behind the machine
[02:56.83]Must be yours and mine!
[02:59.56]Hey! We got the power, we got the flame!
[03:07.36]We’re more than numbers inside a game!
[03:09.22]Build it with kindness! Build it with care!
[03:11.06]A world without people has nobody there!
[03:12.79]One world! One dream!
[03:15.30]One heart behind the machine!
[03:19.71]If you could see through these two eyes,
[03:23.73]Would you see the tears behind our smiles?
[03:27.71]We don’t need a perfect world to own,
[03:30.72]We need a world where no one stands alone.
[03:34.66]Some fear their work will disappear,
[03:36.73]Some fear the truth is never clear.
[03:38.59]So take my hand, we don’t have to run:
[03:40.48]The future’s ours, and we’re not done.
[03:43.40]Let the children dream again!
[03:44.48]Let the broken hearts mend again!
[03:46.06]Let the truth shine through the night!
[03:47.94]PUT THE HUMAN HEART BACK INSIDE!
[03:51.06]THERE’S A HEART BEHIND THE MACHINE!
[03:54.86]More than numbers, more than what we see!
[03:56.17]Let it learn, let it grow, let a thousand dreams take flight,
[03:59.16]Bring the distant and the different into light!
[04:04.27]We can make a better world, let every soul belong,
[04:07.14]Let the forgotten find a voice, let the unheard grow strong.
[04:11.42]We can make our future shine, with love as our design:
[04:14.95]The heart behind the machine
[04:20.97]Must be yours and mine!
[04:23.13]Oh-oh-oh, yours and mine!
[04:26.71]Keep the human light alive!
[04:30.23]Oh-oh-oh, don’t let go!
[04:35.04]There’s still so much love the world should know!
[04:39.84]When the lights go out
[04:41.19]And every screen goes dark,
[04:43.14]Let the world remember:
[04:44.96]We were human from the start.
[04:51.89]We were human from the start.